# Build context filter for infra/sf01/runner.Dockerfile ONLY (BuildKit
# Dockerfile-scoped ignore file). Deliberately not a root .dockerignore, which
# would change every other image's build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.venv
.env
.env.*
.claude
